                                                "sense_id": "9aa44358-1a8b-372b-bbb8-6d13be5064de",
                                                "text": "It is impossible to fully capture the impact of necklacings on South African communities during the mid-1980s. However, it is clear that necklacings united especially the black youth in their liberation struggle."
